<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" itunes:timing="Word"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><ttm:agent type="other" xml:id="v2"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><songwriters><songwriter>BloodPop®</songwriter><songwriter>Charlie Puth</songwriter><songwriter>Hikaru Utada</songwriter></songwriters></iTunesMetadata><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Home (feat. Hikaru Utada)"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Charlie Puth / 宇多田ヒカル"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Whatever&apos;s Clever!"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1845189970"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="3356494231"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Z-MeArs"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:38.295"><div begin="5.940" end="3:38.295"><p begin="5.940" end="7.854" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="5.940" end="6.149">Through</span> <span begin="6.149" end="6.335">the</span> <span begin="6.335" end="6.555">rose-</span><span begin="6.555" end="6.903">colored</span> <span begin="6.903" end="7.854">lenses</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">透过玫瑰色的滤镜</span></p><p begin="8.512" end="10.371" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="8.512" end="8.687">And</span> <span begin="8.687" end="8.875">the</span> <span begin="8.875" end="9.154">white</span> <span begin="9.154" end="9.462">picket</span> <span begin="9.462" end="10.371">fences</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">望向那白色的栅栏</span></p><p begin="10.955" end="15.341" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="10.955" end="11.120">No</span> <span begin="11.120" end="11.374">matter</span> <span begin="11.374" end="11.681">how</span> <span begin="11.681" end="12.001">good</span> <span begin="12.001" end="12.334">this</span> <span begin="12.334" end="12.692">is,</span> <span begin="12.692" end="12.999">it</span> <span begin="12.999" end="13.332">could</span> <span begin="13.332" end="13.842">never</span> <span begin="13.842" end="15.341">satisfy</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">无论这一切看起来多么美好，都永远无法让我满足</span></p><p begin="16.199" end="18.050" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="16.199" end="16.302">When</span> <span begin="16.302" end="16.516">it&apos;s</span> <span begin="16.516" end="16.795">you</span> <span begin="16.795" end="16.930">that</span> <span begin="16.930" end="17.143">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="17.143" end="18.050">missing</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">因为我思念的人是你</span></p><p begin="18.650" end="20.533" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="18.650" end="18.860">Now</span> <span begin="18.860" end="19.035">I</span> <span begin="19.035" end="19.340">sit</span> <span begin="19.340" end="19.474">in</span> <span begin="19.474" end="19.701">the</span> <span begin="19.701" end="20.533">kitchen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">此刻我坐在厨房里</span></p><p begin="21.219" end="26.405" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="21.219" end="21.338">Through</span> <span begin="21.338" end="21.567">the</span> <span begin="21.567" end="22.232">window</span> <span begin="22.232" end="22.605">pane,</span> <span begin="22.605" end="22.913">I</span> <span begin="22.913" end="23.245">watch</span> <span begin="23.245" end="23.553">the</span> <span begin="23.553" end="24.147">day</span> <span begin="24.147" end="24.508">turn</span> <span begin="24.508" end="24.841">to</span> <span begin="24.841" end="26.405">night</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">透过窗户的玻璃，看白昼渐渐隐入黑夜</span></p><p begin="26.405" end="28.722" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="26.405" end="26.702">It</span> <span begin="26.702" end="27.050">ain&apos;t</span> <span begin="27.050" end="27.355">a</span> <span begin="27.355" end="27.631">mys</span><span begin="27.631" end="27.991">te</span><span begin="27.991" end="28.722">ry</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">这并不是什么秘密</span></p><p begin="28.941" end="31.317" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="28.941" end="29.300">That</span> <span begin="29.300" end="29.912">every</span> <span begin="29.912" end="30.220">time</span> <span begin="30.220" end="30.552">you</span> <span begin="30.552" end="31.317">leave</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">每当你离去的时候</span></p><p begin="31.442" end="35.712" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="31.442" end="31.807">That&apos;s</span> <span begin="31.807" end="32.127">when</span> <span begin="32.127" end="32.460">I</span> <span begin="32.460" end="32.793">feel</span> <span begin="32.793" end="33.087">the</span> <span begin="33.087" end="33.780">most</span> <span begin="33.780" end="34.385">a</span><span begin="34.385" end="34.954">lone,</span> <span begin="34.954" end="35.712">oh</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">便是我感到最孤独的时刻</span></p><p begin="35.712" end="39.269" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="35.712" end="37.140">Ooh,</span> <span begin="37.247" end="37.567">don&apos;t</span> <span begin="37.567" end="37.885">you</span> <span begin="37.885" end="39.269">know</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">喔，难道你不知道吗</span></p><p begin="40.071" end="44.221" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="40.071" end="40.427">That</span> <span begin="40.427" end="41.026">you&apos;re</span> <span begin="41.026" end="41.400">the</span> <span begin="41.400" end="41.720">one</span> <span begin="41.720" end="42.012">who</span> <span begin="42.012" end="42.319">makes</span> <span begin="42.319" end="42.667">this</span> <span begin="42.667" end="43.124">house</span> <span begin="43.124" end="43.365">a</span> <span begin="43.365" end="44.221">home</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">唯有你，才让这间屋子有了家的意义</span></p><p begin="45.234" end="49.304" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="45.234" end="45.803">And</span> <span begin="45.803" end="46.877">so,</span> <span begin="47.454" end="47.799">when</span> <span begin="47.799" end="48.134">you</span> <span begin="48.134" end="49.304">go</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">所以，当你离开</span></p><p begin="49.845" end="52.995" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="49.845" end="49.945">It</span> <span begin="49.945" end="50.265">feels</span> <span begin="50.265" end="50.625">so</span> <span begin="50.625" end="51.278">cold</span> <span begin="51.278" end="51.878">without</span> <span begin="51.878" end="52.172">the</span> <span begin="52.172" end="52.995">soul</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">没有了灵魂的支撑，这里变得如此寒冷</span></p><p begin="53.153" end="57.013" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="53.153" end="53.790">You&apos;re</span> <span begin="53.790" end="54.122">the</span> <span begin="54.122" end="54.444">one</span> <span begin="54.444" end="54.777">who</span> <span begin="54.777" end="55.084">makes</span> <span begin="55.084" end="55.404">this</span> <span begin="55.404" end="55.870">house</span> <span begin="55.870" end="56.098">a</span> <span begin="56.098" end="57.013">home</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">唯有你，才让这间屋子成了家</span></p><p begin="1:06.628" end="1:09.179" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:06.628" end="1:06.983">一</span><span begin="1:06.983" end="1:07.395">人</span><span begin="1:07.395" end="1:07.495">の</span><span begin="1:07.495" end="1:07.647">時</span><span begin="1:07.647" end="1:08.156">間</span><span begin="1:08.156" end="1:08.307">も</span><span begin="1:08.307" end="1:08.630">大</span><span begin="1:08.630" end="1:09.179">切</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">虽然独处的时间也很珍贵</span></p><p begin="1:09.775" end="1:11.701" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:09.775" end="1:10.203">誰</span><span begin="1:10.203" end="1:10.538">に</span><span begin="1:10.538" end="1:10.646">も</span><span begin="1:10.646" end="1:11.134">妥協</span><span begin="1:11.134" end="1:11.471">せ</span><span begin="1:11.471" end="1:11.701">ず</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">不必向任何人妥协</span></p><p begin="1:12.310" end="1:16.829" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:12.310" end="1:13.137">私</span><span begin="1:13.137" end="1:13.302">だ</span><span begin="1:13.302" end="1:13.905">けの</span><span begin="1:13.905" end="1:14.005">お</span><span begin="1:14.005" end="1:14.667">城</span><span begin="1:14.667" end="1:15.203">を</span><span begin="1:15.203" end="1:15.936">築い</span><span begin="1:15.936" end="1:16.829">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我曾亲手筑起一座只属于我的城堡</span></p><p begin="1:17.488" end="1:19.522" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:17.488" end="1:17.620">But</span> <span begin="1:17.620" end="1:17.847">it&apos;s</span> <span begin="1:17.847" end="1:18.119">you</span> <span begin="1:18.119" end="1:18.290">I</span> <span begin="1:18.290" end="1:18.492">was</span> <span begin="1:18.492" end="1:19.522">missing</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">但我思念的人始终是你</span></p><p begin="1:19.968" end="1:27.418" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:19.968" end="1:20.428">君</span><span begin="1:20.428" end="1:20.774">に</span><span begin="1:20.774" end="1:21.111">毎</span><span begin="1:21.111" end="1:22.071">日</span><span begin="1:22.643" end="1:23.012">ただ</span><span begin="1:23.012" end="1:23.351">い</span><span begin="1:23.351" end="1:23.889">まと</span><span begin="1:23.889" end="1:24.212">言</span><span begin="1:24.212" end="1:24.875">わせ</span><span begin="1:24.875" end="1:25.515">て</span><span begin="1:25.515" end="1:26.176">くだ</span><span begin="1:26.176" end="1:26.694">さ</span><span begin="1:26.694" end="1:27.418">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">请让我每天都能对你说一声：“你回来啦”</span></p><p begin="1:27.722" end="1:30.122" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:27.722" end="1:28.330">行っ</span><span begin="1:28.330" end="1:28.599">て</span><span begin="1:28.599" end="1:28.927">らっ</span><span begin="1:28.927" end="1:29.354">しゃ</span><span begin="1:29.354" end="1:30.122">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">“路上小心”</span></p><p begin="1:30.221" end="1:36.983" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:30.221" end="1:31.203">君が</span><span begin="1:31.203" end="1:31.843">いな</span><span begin="1:31.843" end="1:32.667">い</span><span begin="1:32.882" end="1:34.357">この家は</span><span begin="1:34.357" end="1:34.486">好</span><span begin="1:34.486" end="1:35.064">き</span><span begin="1:35.064" end="1:35.651">じゃ</span><span begin="1:35.651" end="1:36.232">な</span><span begin="1:36.232" end="1:36.983">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我不喜欢这个没有你在的家</span></p><p begin="1:36.983" end="1:40.727" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:36.983" end="1:38.395">Ooh,</span> <span begin="1:38.567" end="1:38.819">don&apos;t</span> <span begin="1:38.819" end="1:39.139">you</span> <span begin="1:39.139" end="1:40.727">know</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">喔，难道你不知道吗</span></p><p begin="1:41.340" end="1:45.746" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:41.340" end="1:41.729">That</span> <span begin="1:41.729" end="1:42.344">you&apos;re</span> <span begin="1:42.344" end="1:42.664">the</span> <span begin="1:42.664" end="1:42.956">one</span> <span begin="1:42.956" end="1:43.263">who</span> <span begin="1:43.263" end="1:43.583">makes</span> <span begin="1:43.583" end="1:43.903">this</span> <span begin="1:43.903" end="1:44.383">house</span> <span begin="1:44.383" end="1:44.637">a</span> <span begin="1:44.637" end="1:45.746">home</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">唯有你，才让这间屋子有了家的意义</span></p><p begin="1:46.488" end="1:51.028" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:46.488" end="1:47.114">And</span> <span begin="1:47.114" end="1:48.519">so,</span> <span begin="1:48.727" end="1:49.060">when</span> <span begin="1:49.060" end="1:49.380">you</span> <span begin="1:49.380" end="1:51.028">go</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">所以，当你离开</span></p><p begin="1:51.252" end="1:54.431" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:51.252" end="1:51.648">夏</span><span begin="1:51.648" end="1:51.984">でも</span><span begin="1:51.984" end="1:52.944">凍</span><span begin="1:52.944" end="1:53.291">え</span><span begin="1:53.291" end="1:53.636">ちゃい</span><span begin="1:53.636" end="1:53.876">そ</span><span begin="1:53.876" end="1:54.431">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">即使在盛夏，我也仿佛被冻僵</span></p><p begin="1:54.458" end="1:58.362" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:54.458" end="1:55.461">君</span><span begin="1:55.461" end="1:55.805">の</span><span begin="1:55.805" end="1:56.519">温</span><span begin="1:56.519" end="1:56.783">も</span><span begin="1:56.783" end="1:57.267">り</span><span begin="1:57.267" end="1:57.427">が</span><span begin="1:57.427" end="1:58.362">Home</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你的体温，才是家</span></p><p begin="1:59.590" end="2:02.944" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:59.590" end="2:01.461">Oh,</span> <span begin="2:01.461" end="2:01.807">you&apos;re</span> <span begin="2:01.807" end="2:02.127">the</span> <span begin="2:02.127" end="2:02.944">one</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">喔，唯有你</span></p><p begin="2:02.763" end="2:04.670" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:02.763" end="2:03.098">You&apos;re</span> <span begin="2:03.098" end="2:03.418">the</span> <span begin="2:03.418" end="2:04.670">one</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">唯有你</span></p><p begin="2:04.697" end="2:08.764" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="2:04.697" end="2:05.295">You&apos;re</span> <span begin="2:05.295" end="2:05.642">the</span> <span begin="2:05.642" end="2:05.935">one</span> <span begin="2:05.935" end="2:06.255">who</span> <span begin="2:06.255" end="2